.TH CHM-INSTALL-DEV-SUITE 1
.SH NAME
chm-install-dev-suite \- install compilers, assemblers, debuggers and build tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tools/ide/install-development-suite.sh
.RI [ --with-vscodium ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Installs native compiler, assembler, debugger, disassembler, cross-emulation and build dependencies using the host package manager.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --with-vscodium
Also invoke the official package-manager VSCodium installer.
